Dear Valued Customer, We hope this message finds you well. At SecureTech, we are committed to providing you with the highest level of security and service. As part of our ongoing efforts to enhance your experience, we are excited to announce the launch of several new security features that will be available to all users starting next week. **New Security Features:** 1. **Two-Factor Authentication (2FA)**: To add an extra layer of protection to your account, we will be implementing 2FA. This feature will require you to verify your identity through a secondary method, such as a text message or authentication app, whenever you log in from a new device. 2. **Real-Time Alerts**: You will now receive real-time notifications for any suspicious activities detected on your account. This will help you stay informed and take immediate action if necessary. 3. **Enhanced Password Recovery Options**: We've improved our password recovery process to make it easier and more secure. You can now use biometric authentication, such as fingerprint or facial recognition, if your device supports it. **What You Need to Do:** To take full advantage of these new features, please log into your account and navigate to the “Security Settings” section. We recommend that you enable 2FA as soon as it becomes available. Detailed instructions will be provided on the platform. **Customer Support:** Should you have any questions